Objects are *always* teleported if you zap them with a wand of
teleportation.  Monsters may, I think, resist under certain
circumstances.  Also, of course, you neglected the other possibility,
namely that your quest artifact gets teleported to a square containing
other objects which happen to mask its presence (a boulder carried by a
giant, say).  Your object detection magic may be fooled; your nemesis
will not be.

>Plus if you nemesis gets the artifact you are not any worse than if
